BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston
 .com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Noche-De-Liberacion-at-Axelrad-Beer-Garden
 .jpg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston.com/wp-content/uploads
 /2026/08/Noche-De-Liberacion-at-Axelrad-Beer-Garden.jpg
UID:VvJChWb-0uwlwS2iN4u-y
SUMMARY:Noche De Liberación at Axelrad Beer Garden
DTSTAMP:20260822T032656Z
DTSTART:20260821T160000Z
DESCRIPTION:Workers Defense Project hosts Noche De Liberación\, an evening 
	of community and solidarity with immigrant workers and families in Texas\,
	 at Axelrad Beer Garden. \nAll are welcome to show up and enjoy music\, pi
	zza\, lotería\, banner painting\, and a signature cocktail while spending 
	time with neighbors and fellow supporters. \nFor every signature event coc
	ktail ordered at the event\, Axelrad will donate $1 to Workers Defense. \n
	Families and all ages are welcome. Axelrad becomes 21+ only at 8pm. Axelra
	d’s Noches Calientes with Discoteka follows the event for ages 21+. \nThe 
	fundraiser supports Workers Defense\, and donations are welcome at any tim
	e. \nAdmission\nFree. Learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was 
	sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images a
	nd more details.  \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\,
	 business\, or offer across all of our channels.\n\nhttps://365thingsinhou
	ston.com/calendar/noche-de-liberacion-at-axelrad-beer-garden/\n\nFrom 365 
	Things to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/noche-de-liberacion-at-axelrad-
	beer-garden/
LOCATION:Axelrad Beer Garden\, 1517 Alabama St\, Houston\, TX\, 77004\, Uni
	ted States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:365-things-houston
CATEGORIES:365 Things to Do in Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT3H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston
 .com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/The-Girl-on-the-Train-at-Alley-Theatre.jpg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston.com/wp-content/uploads
 /2026/07/The-Girl-on-the-Train-at-Alley-Theatre.jpg
UID:_Hub8LXvn9DYDnvdTgiA6
SUMMARY:The Girl on the Train at Alley Theatre
DTSTAMP:20260822T032656Z
DTSTART:20260821T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Alley Theatre presents The Girl on the Train\, the 2026 product
	ion in Alley’s annual Summer Chills series\, live on stage in Downtown. \n
	The modern psychological thriller\, adapted from the best-selling novel an
	d hit film\, follows Rachel\, a woman struggling with dependency. \nShe mu
	st piece together her fragmented memories to find a girl who’s gone missin
	g. As her night comes back to her\, she considers\, “Who can you trust whe
	n you can’t trust yourself?” \nAdmission\nTickets start at $32. Order tick
	ets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by th
	e event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details
	. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or o
	ffer across all of our channels. \n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston.com/calend
	ar/the-girl-on-the-train-at-alley-theatre-32/\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do in 
	Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/the-girl-on-the-train-at-alley-
	theatre-32/
LOCATION:Alley Theatre\, 615 Texas St\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United State
	s
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:365-things-houston
CATEGORIES:365 Things to Do in Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H
END:VEVENT
