BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston
 .com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Reset-at-Jubilee.jpg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston.com/wp-content/uploads
 /2026/08/Reset-at-Jubilee.jpg
UID:LGUZw8mEuntLIhq4gNVPt
SUMMARY:Reset at Jubilee
DTSTAMP:20260822T032656Z
DTSTART:20260822T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:Jubilee\, the joyful neighborhood in Hockley\, northwest of Hou
	ston\, celebrates Wellness Month with Reset\, a free evening designed to h
	elp everyone relax\, recharge\, and reconnect. \nOpen to everyone who RSVP
	s for free\, Reset offers yoga\, Zumba\, chair massages\, wellness activit
	ies and more at JoyHub\, Jubilee’s community recreation center. \nAs the e
	vening winds down\, guests will gather by the water for a beautiful floati
	ng lantern release—a peaceful way to let go\, reflect and set an intention
	 for what’s ahead. \nAdmission\nTickets are free with RSVP. RSVP now or le
	arn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event o
	rganizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details.  \nLear
	n more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer acr
	oss all of our channels.\n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/reset-
	at-jubilee/\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/reset-at-jubilee/
LOCATION:Jubilee Model Home Haven\, 26134 Happy Home St\, Hockley\, TX\, 77
	447\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:365-things-houston
CATEGORIES:365 Things to Do in Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT4H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston
 .com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Candlelight-Concert-Coldplay-Imagine-Drago
 ns.jpeg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston.com/wp-content/uploads
 /2025/04/Candlelight-Concert-Coldplay-Imagine-Dragons.jpeg
UID:9ZQCJP8LbS36N54sCz9cO
SUMMARY:Candlelight Concert: Coldplay & Imagine Dragons at Resurrection MCC
DTSTAMP:20260822T032656Z
DTSTART:20260822T183000Z
DESCRIPTION:Fever presents Candlelight: Coldplay & Imagine Dragons by the L
	isteso String Quartet at Resurrection MCC in the Heights. \nThe live\, 60-
	minute\, multi-sensory string musical experience will showcase Coldplay hi
	ts like “Clocks” and “Fix You” and Imagine Dragon’s favorites like “Radioa
	ctive” and “Eyes Closed”—all performed under the gentle glow of candleligh
	t. \nFuture dates available. \nCandlelight Concert Series\nThe performance
	 is a Fever Original and part of the ongoing Candlelght Concert Series hap
	pening around Houston every week. \nSee upcoming Candlelight concerts from
	 Fever \nAdmission\nTickets are $28.50 and up\, but may fluctuate based on
	 demand. Order tickets or learn more. \n \nIf you make a purchase followin
	g links to Fever in this calendar listing\, you’re supporting 365 Houston 
	and our staff and contributors. We may receive a small commission from Fev
	er on any purchase you make—at no additional cost to you. \nLearn more abo
	ut advertising your event\, business\, product or service.\n\nhttps://365t
	hingsinhouston.com/calendar/candlelight-concert-coldplay-imagine-dragons-a
	t-resurrection-mcc-4/\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/candlelight-concert-coldplay-im
	agine-dragons-at-resurrection-mcc-4/
LOCATION:Resurrection MCC\, 2025 W 11th St\, Houston\, TX\, 77008\, United 
	States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:365-things-houston
CATEGORIES:365 Things to Do in Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H
END:VEVENT
