UID:PSIndhCLVlT8plZWP1S5J
SUMMARY:Boxing: Rolly Romero vs Teofimo Lopez Watch Party at Social Beer Ga
	rden HTX
DTSTAMP:20260822T032656Z
DTSTART:20260822T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Social Beer Garden HTX hosts a watch party for the WBA Welterwe
	ight World Championship and the showdown between Rolly Romero and Teofimo 
	Lopez live. \nIt will be an evening of intense boxing action in Midtown. \
	n\n\nMultiple food trucks will be on site. \n\n\n\nAdmission\nNo cover. Le
	arn more. \n\n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event
	 organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLea
	rn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer ac
